From 7afa833d1babcc5dd62ef326f81c52835f9aa349 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: vince <vincepaul.liem@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 15:52:02 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(launch): capture snapshots over private host control

Accept bounded sequenced capture requests over an inherited Unix stream
socket, acknowledge after complete publication, and cancel on peer loss.
Reuse the archive owner with distinct staging names for repeated captures.
Wake task/control processing through private signalfd and poll while
keeping wait4 as the sole task-status owner.

Signed-off-by: vince <vincepaul.liem@gmail.com>
